From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:58:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] security: exclude host credentials from peer-pod data

Provider credentials are needed by the host adaptor, not by the PodVM.
Separate bootstrap credentials from the guest payload and forward only
the non-secret cloud configuration required by the guest.

Preserve initdata and direct-volume metadata while excluding host access
keys and policy material from the PodVM request.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Generated-by: OpenAI Codex
